@host = http://localhost:5113

########## BÀI 1 (kế thừa): SRP + OCP ##########
### Danh sách sản phẩm
GET {{host}}/api/products

### OCP - áp dụng (Strategy)
GET {{host}}/api/shipping/fee-preview?method=Express&itemsAmount=450000

### OCP - vi phạm (switch-case)
GET {{host}}/api/shipping/legacy-fee-preview?method=Express&itemsAmount=450000

### SRP - đặt hàng chuẩn
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Le Van C", "email": "c@shop.vn", "productId": 1, "quantity": 2, "shippingMethod": 2 }

### SRP - đặt hàng God class (vi phạm)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/bad
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "Bad Guy", "email": "bad@shop.vn", "productId": 4, "quantity": 1, "shippingMethod": 3 }

########## BÀI 2: LSP + ISP + DIP (nghiệp vụ e-commerce) ##########

### LSP - VI PHẠM: voucher dùng-1-lần ném Exception -> sập API (500)
GET {{host}}/api/lsp/violation?orderAmount=500000

### LSP - GIẢI PHÁP: trả VoucherResult (success/fail) -> API mượt (200)
GET {{host}}/api/lsp/solution?orderAmount=500000

### ISP - VI PHẠM: Customer bị ép DeleteOrder -> NotSupportedException
GET {{host}}/api/isp/violation

### ISP - GIẢI PHÁP: tách IOrderReadService / IOrderManageService
GET {{host}}/api/isp/solution

### DIP - VI PHẠM: new EmailSender + GetType().Name
GET {{host}}/api/dip/violation?customer=Le Van C&contact=c@shop.vn&total=300000

### DIP - GIẢI PHÁP: inject IOrderStore + INotificationSender qua DI
GET {{host}}/api/dip/solution?customer=Le Van C&contact=0900123456&total=300000
